  {title:'Simple planning and editing',terms:[['plan','decide ideas/order before writing'],['edit','improve and correct writing']],explain:'Before writing, list the main points. After writing, check meaning, capitals, punctuation, spelling and verb agreement.',example:'A short description of your school can be planned as place → buildings → people → what you value about it.',check:'What should you check after you finish a paragraph?'}
